DESCRIPTION: \n________________________________\n\nFrom: Brandt Pullins <Pu
	llinsBG@ChurchofJesusChrist.org>\nSent: Monday\, October 6\, 2025 10:07:24
	 PM (UTC-07:00) Mountain Time (US & Canada)\nTo: Service Customer <scustom
	er@dmba.com>\nSubject: RE: [Ext:] Open Enrollment reminder: Choose your 20
	26 benefits by November 7\nWhen: Monday\, October 13\, 2025 8:00 AM-8:30 A
	M.\nWhere: \n\n\n	\nCAUTION: This email originated from outside DMBA. Do n
	ot click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and kno
	w the content is safe. \n\n\n\n________________________________\n\nFrom: D
	MBA <customer-service@dmba.com>\nSent: Tuesday\, October 7\, 2025 12:09:39
	 AM\nTo: Brandt Pullins <PullinsBG@ChurchofJesusChrist.org>\nSubject: [Ext
	:] Open Enrollment reminder: Choose your 2026 benefits by November 7 \n \n
	\n[External Email]\n\n \n <https://www.dmba.com/?utm_source=link_click&utm
	_medium=email&utm_campaign=REM105EN1OEA1025> 	\n__________________________
	______\n\n <https://www.dmba.com/assets/images/emailimages/g1-english-dmai
	l-banner.jpg> \n\nOur records indicate that your Open Enrollment elections
	 for 2026 have not yet been confirmed in the online system. Please log in 
	to www.dmba.com <http://www.dmba.com/>  and make changes to your benefits 
	for 2026—medical\, dental\, vision\, etc.—by Friday\, November 7.\n\nD
	on't forget to fund your Flexible Spending Account (Healthcare\, Limited P
	urpose\, and/or Dependent Care) for 2026! Finalize your election amount by
	 Friday\, December 5.\n\nREM105EN1OEA1025\n\n_____________________________
	___\n\nHelping our plan participants\nbe healthy and prepare for retiremen
	t\n\ncustomer-service@dmba.com <mailto:customer-service@dmba.com>   |  www
	.dmba.com <https://www.dmba.com/?utm_source=link_click&utm_medium=email&ut
	m_campaign=REM105EN1OEA1025> \n© Deseret Mutual Benefit Administrators\n\
	nIf you need a printed copy and can't print this notice\, contact us and w
	e will send one to you. \n \n <http://www.google-analytics.com/collect?v=1
	&tid=UA-40787810-1&cid=001&t=event&ec=email&ea=open&el=REM105EN1OEA1025&cs
	=open&cm=email&cn=REM105EN1OEA1025> \nClick here to unsubscribe <https://w
	ww2.dmba.com/DMBA_General/EmailUnsubscribe?id=6A27EBA781B288673B62E2D7244A
	33D37> \n
