DESCRIPTION:Hello DMBA\,\n\nWith the festive holiday season fast approachin
	g\, we are excited to announce DMBA's Christmas Awards Luncheon on Decembe
	r 4th\, from 12:00 pm to 2:00 pm at the Salt Lake City Hilton. This event 
	is a wonderful opportunity for us to come together\, celebrate the holiday
	 spirit\, and recognize the outstanding achievements we've made this year.
	\n\nWe're looking forward to celebrating with you and sharing some festive
	 cheer. More details will follow\, so stay tuned. We can't wait to see you
	 there.\n\n \n\nKind regards\,\n\n \n\nAndy\n\nMichele\n\n \n\n\n\n \n\n \
	n\n
DTEND;TZID="Mountain Standard Time":20251204T140000
