	I&quot\;\,sans-serif\;color:#242424">Hello DMBA\,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p 
	class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:.25in"><span style="font-family:&qu
	ot\;Segoe UI&quot\;\,sans-serif\;color:#242424">With the festive holiday s
	eason fast approaching\, we are excited to announce DMBA's Christmas Award
	s Luncheon on December 4th\, from 12:00 pm to 2:00 pm at the Salt Lake Cit
	y Hilton. This event is a wonderful opportunity for us to come together\, 
	celebrate the holiday spirit\, and recognize the outstanding achievements 
	we've made this year.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span styl
	e="font-family:&quot\;Segoe UI&quot\;\,sans-serif\;color:#242424">We're lo
	oking forward to celebrating with you and sharing some festive cheer. More
	 details will follow\, so stay tuned. We can't wait to see you there.<o:p>
