DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, October 7: Public Funeral Services\n\n*	The funeral w
	ill be held in the Conference Center on Temple Square on Tuesday\, October
	 7\, 2025\, at 12 p.m. MDT. The funeral will be open to the public\, ages 
	8 and older. Tickets will be required and will become available online on 
	Thursday\, October 2\, at 10 a.m. The building will open at 10:30 a.m. Tho
	se who attend the funeral services must be seated no later than 11:30 a.m.
	 Church office buildings on the Temple Square campus will be closed from 1
	1 a.m. to 3 p.m. Services will be broadcast globally on ChurchofJesusChris
	t.org\, YouTube\, BYUtv and KSL beginning at 12 p.m. MDT. More details on 
	languages will be provided later.\n*	DMBA will close operations from 12:00
	 pm to 1:30 pm for the funeral. Employees can use this time to watch the f
	uneral or for some other purpose. If employees have tickets and wish to at
	tend the funeral in person\, they can work with their managers if that is 
	possible based on their responsibilities. Additional time (before 12:00 pm
	 and after to 1:30 pm) will be personal time.\n\n \n\n\n\n________________
