X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><head>\n<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" 
	content="text/html\; charset=Windows-1252"></head>\n<body>\n<p style="text
	-align: left\; text-indent: 0px\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\;
	 margin: 0in\;" class="elementToProof">\n<span style="font-family: Aptos\,
	 sans-serif\; font-size: 11pt\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;"><u>Tuesday\, Octo
	ber 7: Public Funeral Services</u></span></p>\n<ul style="text-align: left
	\; margin-top: 0in\; margin-bottom: 0in\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\
	, 255)\;">\n<li style="font-family: Aptos\, sans-serif\; font-size: 12pt\;
	 color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; margin: 0in\;" class="elementToProof">\n<span rol
	e="presentation" style="font-size: 11pt\;">The funeral will be held in the
	 Conference Center on Temple Square on Tuesday\, October 7\, 2025\, at 12 
	p.m. MDT. The funeral will be open to the public\, ages 8 and older. Ticke
	ts will be required and will become\n available online on Thursday\, Octob
	er 2\, at 10&nbsp\;a.m. The building will open at 10:30 a.m. Those who att
	end the funeral services must be seated no later than 11:30 a.m. Church of
	fice buildings on the Temple Square campus will be closed from 11 a.m. to 
	3 p.m.\n Services will be broadcast globally on ChurchofJesusChrist.org\, 
	YouTube\, BYUtv and KSL beginning at 12 p.m. MDT. More details on language
	s will be provided later.</span></li><li style="font-family: Aptos\, sans-
	serif\; font-size: 12pt\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\; margin: 0in\;" class="el
	ementToProof">\n<span role="presentation" style="font-size: 11pt\;"><b>DMB
	A will close operations from 12:00 pm to 1:30 pm for the funeral. Employee
	s can use this time to watch the funeral or for some other purpose. If emp
	loyees have tickets and wish to attend the funeral in\n person\, they can 
	work with their managers if that is possible based on their responsibiliti
	es. Additional time (before 12:00 pm and after to 1:30 pm) will be persona
	l time.</b></span></li></ul>\n<p style="text-align: left\; text-indent: 0p
	x\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\; margin: 0in\;" class="element
	ToProof">\n<span style="font-family: Aptos\, sans-serif\; font-size: 11pt\
	; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<div style="font-family: Ap
