	ndon Powell\nSubject: CI/CD Engagement - Slalom/DMBA\nWhen: Monday\, July 
	14\, 2025 3:30 PM-4:00 PM (UTC-07:00) Mountain Time (US & Canada).\nWhere:
	 Microsoft Teams Meeting\n\n \n\n	CAUTION: This email originated from outs
	ide DMBA. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the 
	sender and know the content is safe. \n\n \n\nAgenda:\n\n*	Introductions\n
	*	Understand the details of what you’re looking for so we can jointly sh
	ape an engagement that aligns with your needs. \n\n	*	Scope\, timing\n\n*	
	Provide perspective on how we think about establishing a more modern pipel
	ine structure.\n\n \n\nThanks\n\n \n\nNate\n\n____________________________
