DESCRIPTION:Everyday Creativity: Fueling Wellness Through Imagination\n\n\n
	Description:\nJoin us at 12:00pm to discover how small sparks of creativit
	y can lead to big boosts in well-being. This interactive session\, led by 
	Dr. Kate O'Farrell\, explores the science behind creativity and its powerf
	ul connection to mental health\, stress reduction\, and cognitive flexibil
	ity. Through playful icebreakers\, research-backed insights\, and hands-on
	 activities\, you'll learn practical strategies to unlock your creative po
	tential—no artistic talent required. Whether you're looking to break rou
	tine\, overcome perfectionism\, or simply add more joy to your day\, this 
	session offers tools you can use immediately. Join us to reimagine creativ
	ity as a daily wellness habit.\n\nDetails:\nThis will be a virtual present
	ation through Teams on Wednesday\, July 16th from 12:00pm-1:00pm. \n\nSpea
	ker Bio\n\nDr. Kate O’Farrell is an Assistant Professor and Clinical Coo
	rdinator in the Department of Health and Kinesiology at the University of 
	Utah. Kate has a PhD in Health and Kinesiology\, an MS in Exercise Physiol
	ogy and Health Coaching\, and a dual BS in Exercise Science and French Stu
	dies. Kate is a National Board Certified Health and Wellness Coach (NBC-HW
	C) and an ACSM Certified Exercise Physiologist. Kate’s research focuses 
	on trauma-informed practices\, resilience\, and physical activity interven
	tions.\n\n \n\nIn addition to her research\, Kate is dedicated to teaching
	 and mentoring. She has developed and taught a variety of courses\, from E
	xercise Physiology and Psychology to Health Behavior Change. She is passio
	nate about fostering inclusive and engaging learning environments and has 
	presented on topics such as trauma-informed pedagogy and topics across all
	 domains of health. Outside of work\, Kate loves playing in the mountains\
	, swimming in cold water\, reading just about anything\, and eating tacos 
	as often as she can.\n\n\n________________________________________________
