	ble information and leave with tangible action steps to complete throughou
	t the month of June. \n\n \n\nDetails:\n\nThis will be an in-person presen
	tation with the option to join virtually through Teams on Thursday\, June 
	5th from 12:00pm-1:00pm. \n\n\n\n_________________________________________
