	le="word-wrap:break-word"><div class="WordSection1"><p class="MsoNormal"><
	span style="font-size:11.0pt">Hello everyone!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p clas
	s="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p>
	<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">We are going to have f
	ood catered from MO&#8217\;BETTAHS for our BBQ party this year!<o:p></o:p>
	</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\
	;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">If y
	ou have not already responded to this invite\, please do so before end of 
	this Friday 05/09/2025.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span st
	yle="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><
	span style="mso-ligatures:none"><img width="575" height="511" style="width
	:5.9895in\;height:5.3229in" id="Picture_x0020_3" src="cid:image003.png@01D
	BBE90.B28636F0"></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p></o:p></span></
	p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></
	span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;<
	/o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Here a
	re the details -<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="fo
	nt-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span st
	yle="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><
	span style="mso-ligatures:none"><img width="708" height="942" style="width
	:7.375in\;height:9.8125in" id="Picture_x0020_1" src="cid:image001.png@01DB
	B9F2.00CC3A10"></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p></o:p></span></p
	><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></s
	pan></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</
	o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&n
	bsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">
	Thank you\,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-si
	ze:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="
	mso-ligatures:none">DMBA &#8211\; IT Culture Club<o:p></o:p></span></p><p 
	class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt\;color:#1F497D\;mso-ligatu
	res:none"><img width="93" height="25" style="width:.9687in\;height:.2604in
