	 class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span
	></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-size:
	11.0pt">Thanks in advance to everyone for taking time away from their fami
	lies to help with this move!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" sty
	le="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">The hope is that ever
	ything will go smoothly and we won’t even take the full hour.<o:p></o:p>
	</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in"><u><span style="f
	ont-size:11.0pt"><br>Here are the high level steps we will follow this eve
	ning to deploy the code:<o:p></o:p></span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal" sty
	le="margin-left:.5in"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></s
	pan></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li class="MsoListParagraph
	" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:
	11.0pt">Corb - Take snap shots of the servers before we move the code.<o:p
	></o:p></span></li><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="circle"><li class="Mso
	Normal" style="mso-list:l1 level2 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">If 
	any issues are found with the below steps that can’t be fixed quickly\, 
	we will revert back to the snap shots<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><li class
	="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt
	">Doug - Take node 1 out of service and deploy the new code to it.<o:p></o
	:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span
	 style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug\, Josh - Point our PCs to the node that is 
	out of service using our host file.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNo
	rmal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug\
	, Josh - Test a few pages on the node that is out of service to see if thi
	ngs look to be working.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style=
	"mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Decision point
	 - Is the site working with the new code?</span></b><span style="font-size
	:11.0pt"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 l
	evel1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Josh - Simulate a large amount 
	of requests to the site that is out of service.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li 
	class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:1
	1.0pt">Doug - Monitor the socket usage on the node that is out of service.
	 <o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lf
	o3"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Decision point - Are we happy with t
	he socket usage and can we make this live to the public?</span></b><span s
	tyle="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style
	="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug - Put node 
	1 back in service. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso
	-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug - Take node 2 ou
	t of service. <o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list
	:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug\, Josh - Remove the h
	ost file entry <o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-lis
	t:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug\, Josh - Test a few 
	pages on dmba.com to see if things still look to be working.<o:p></o:p></s
	pan></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><b><span st
	yle="font-size:11.0pt">Decision point - Is everything working correctly? A
	re we ready to move both nodes live.</span></b><span style="font-size:11.0
	pt"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1
	 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug - Deploy the new code to node 2
	<o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo
	3"><span style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug - Put node 2 back in service<o:p></
	o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><spa
	n style="font-size:11.0pt">Doug\, Josh - Monitor the site for errors (this
	 will be ongoing for the next couple of days)<o:p></o:p></span></li><li cl
	ass="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><span style="font-size:11.
	0pt">Larsen - Run some socket tests to verify the fix is working. (This wi
	ll happen later in the evening when he is available)<o:p></o:p></span></li
	></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:
	p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><o:p>&nbs
	p\;</o:p></span></p><div><div style="margin-bottom:.25in\;overflow:hidden"
