DESCRIPTION:Sustainability Webinar\n\n\nDescription:\nPeter Nelson of Salt 
	Lake City’s Energy & Environment Division\, and Kyle Fuchshuber of the W
	aste & Recycling Division will be offering an overview of how the City is 
	prioritizing support for clean air\, renewable energy\, and a zero-waste f
	uture\, and what actions residents and visitors can take to contribute to 
	these community-wide goals. Peter will discuss energy efficiency and zero-
	emission transportation opportunities available to residents and business 
	owners\, and Kyle will provide insight into Salt Lake City’s waste diver
	sion system and how to maximize the impact of our individual recycling eff
	orts.  \n\nDetails:\nThis will be a virtual presentation through Teams on 
	Monday\, April 14th from 12:00pm-1:00pm. \n\n_____________________________
	___________________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams Need 
	help? <https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa
