DESCRIPTION:Hi.\n\n \n\nDoug created a basic proof of concept of how we can
	 do the delegated access task. This meeting will be to review the approach
	 Doug came up with and come up with a rough estimation of hours before mee
	ting with the rest of the team. \n\n \n\nI think we can knock this out wit
	h a 30 minute meeting. If it takes longer\, we’ll schedule a follow up. 
	Also\, if timing is bad\, please let me know and we’ll reschedule.\n\n \
	n\nThanks.\n\n \n\nJosh\n\n_______________________________________________
