DESCRIPTION:Hello! (This is not April Fools 😊!) \n\nWe are gathering t
	ogether to discuss the following:\n\n*	What happened\n*	Why it happened\n*
		Timeline of response\n*	What can we do to prevent this in the future\n\n 
	\n\nJeremy\, Jordan\, and I will take the information from this meeting to
	 determine what process changes may be needed.\n\n \n\nThank you all so mu
	ch for your communication\, collaboration\, and hard work to get us up and
	 running again after the outage.\n\n \n\n \n\n____________________________
