	link="#467886" vlink="#96607D" style="word-wrap:break-word"><div class="Wo
	rdSection1"><p class="MsoNormal">Hello! (This is not April Fools <span sty
	le="font-family:&quot\;Segoe UI Emoji&quot\;\,sans-serif">&#128522\;</span
	>!) <o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">We are gathering together to discu
	ss the following:<o:p></o:p></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li
	 class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3"
	>What happened<o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-l
	eft:0in\;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3">Why it happened<o:p></o:p></li><li class
	="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3">Timel
	ine of response<o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-
	left:0in\;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo3">What can we do to prevent this in the f
	uture<o:p></o:p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p cl
	ass="MsoNormal">Jeremy\, Jordan\, and I will take the information from thi
	s meeting to determine what process changes may be needed.<o:p></o:p></p><
	p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">Thank you a
	ll so much for your communication\, collaboration\, and hard work to get u
	s up and running again after the outage.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal
	"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><div><d
