DESCRIPTION:Pizza will be here at 12:15 so we’re moving the start time to
	 12.\n\n \n\nHi everyone\,\n\nPlease join us to for a pizza lunch to celeb
	rate Mike’s retirement.  It’s a great opportunity to appreciate his 41
	+ years of dedicated service and wish him well on his next adventure!\n\nP
	lease respond by Friday 3/14 so we can plan for food.\n\n \n\nThanks! Rich
	\n\n \n\n\n\n_____________________________________________________________
