DESCRIPTION:Ergonomics Webinar\n\n\nDescription:\nJoin us at 1:00 to learn 
	how to adjust your workstation to maximize productivity and reduce discomf
	ort\, fatigue\, and injury. Rachel Ludlow\, a certified Office Ergonomics 
	Evaluator\, will provide helpful tips and information so you can optimize 
	your ergonomics. \n\nDetails:\nThis will be a virtual presentation through
	 Teams on Wednesday\, March 26th from 12:00pm-1:00pm. \n\n________________
