DESCRIPTION:Healthy Sleep Webinar\n\nDescription:\nAre you interested in im
	proving your sleep habits? Join us at 12:00 to learn about the basics of s
	leep including why we sleep\, the importance of sleep\, and normal sleep p
	atterns with Dr. Kevin Walker from the Intermountain Sleep Disorders Cente
	r. Gain a better understanding of what can interfere with sleep and leave 
	with tangible ways to improve your sleep! \n\n\nDetails:\nThis will be a v
	irtual presentation through Teams on Tuesday\, March 11th from 12:00-1:00.
	 After the live session\, there will be a recording available through the 
	Wellbeing Webinar link on Inside. \n\n\nSpeaker Bio:\nDr. Kevin Walker is 
	a native of Midvale\, Utah.  He majored in music at BYU before completing 
	his medical degree at The Ohio State University.  During his residency tra
	ining in neurology at the University of Utah\, he was introduced to the fi
	eld of sleep medicine\, prompting him to pursue a sleep fellowship.  He’
	s practiced sleep medicine for 14 years and currently works at the Intermo
	untain Sleep Disorders Center.  He loves sleep and any opportunity to talk
	 about it with others.\n\n________________________________________________
