X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><head>\n<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" 
	content="text/html\; charset=Windows-1252"></head>\n<body>\n<div class="el
	ementToProof" style="text-align: left\; text-indent: 0px\; background-colo
	r: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\; margin: 0px\; font-family: Aptos\, Aptos_Embedde
	dFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size
	: 14pt\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">\n<b>Healthy Sleep Webinar</b></div>\n<d
	iv style="text-align: left\; text-indent: 0px\; background-color: rgb(255\
	, 255\, 255)\; margin: 0px\; font-family: Aptos\, Aptos_EmbeddedFont\, Apt
	os_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 11pt\; co
	lor: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">\n<br>\n</div>\n<div style="text-align: left\; text
	-indent: 0px\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\; margin: 0px\; font
	-family: Aptos\, Aptos_EmbeddedFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helv
	etica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 11pt\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">\nDescript
	ion:</div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left\; text-ind
	ent: 0px\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\; margin: 0px\; font-fam
	ily: Aptos\, Aptos_EmbeddedFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helvetic
	a\, sans-serif\;">\n<span style="font-size: 11pt\; color: rgb(36\, 36\, 36
	)\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\;">Are you interested in improv
	ing your sleep habits? Join us at 12:00 to learn about the basics of sleep
	 including why we sleep\, the importance of sleep\, and normal sleep\n pat
	terns with <b>Dr. Kevin Walker</b> </span><span style="font-size: 14.6667p
	x\; color: rgb(36\, 36\, 36)\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\;">f
	rom the\n</span><span style="font-size: 14.6667px\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\
	; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\;"><b>Intermountain Sleep Disorde
	rs Center.\n</b></span><span style="font-size: 11pt\; color: rgb(36\, 36\,
	 36)\; background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\;">Gain a better understandi
	ng of what can interfere with sleep and leave with tangible ways to improv
	e your sleep!&nbsp\;</span></div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font
	-family: Aptos\, Aptos_EmbeddedFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helv
	etica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 11pt\; color: rgb(36\, 36\, 36)\;">\n<span
	 style="background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\;"><br>\n</span></div>\n<di
	v class="elementToProof" style="text-align: left\; text-indent: 0px\; back
	ground-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\; margin: 0px\; font-family: Aptos\, Ap
	tos_EmbeddedFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helvetica\, sans-serif\
	; font-size: 11pt\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">\nDetails:</div>\n<div class=
	"elementToProof" style="text-align: left\; text-indent: 0px\; background-c
	olor: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\; margin: 0px\; font-family: Aptos\, Aptos_Embe
	ddedFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-s
	ize: 11pt\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">\nThis will be a <b>virtual&nbsp\;pre
	sentation through&nbsp\;Teams</b>&nbsp\;<b>on Tuesday\, March 11th from 12
	:00-1:00.</b>&nbsp\;After the live session\, there will be a recording ava
	ilable through the Wellbeing Webinar link on Inside.&nbsp\;</div>\n<div cl
	ass="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos\, Aptos_EmbeddedFont\, Apto
	s_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 14.6667px\
	; color: rgb(36\, 36\, 36)\;">\n<span style="background-color: rgb(255\, 2
	55\, 255)\;"><br>\n</span></div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-
	family: Aptos\, Aptos_EmbeddedFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helve
	tica\, sans-serif\; font-size: 14.6667px\; color: rgb(36\, 36\, 36)\;">\n<
	span style="background-color: rgb(255\, 255\, 255)\;">Speaker Bio:</span><
	/div>\n<div class="elementToProof" style="font-family: Aptos\, Aptos_Embed
	dedFont\, Aptos_MSFontService\, Calibri\, Helvetica\, sans-serif\; font-si
	ze: 11pt\; color: rgb(0\, 0\, 0)\;">\n<span style="background-color: rgb(2
	55\, 255\, 255)\;">Dr. Kevin Walker is a native of Midvale\, Utah.&nbsp\; 
	He majored in music at BYU before completing his medical degree at The Ohi
	o State University.&nbsp\; During his residency training in neurology at t
	he University of\n Utah\, he was introduced to the field of sleep medicine
	\, prompting him to pursue a sleep fellowship.&nbsp\; He’s practiced sle
	ep medicine for 14 years and currently works at the Intermountain Sleep Di
	sorders Center.&nbsp\; He loves sleep and any opportunity to talk about\n 
	it with others.</span></div>\n<div class="elementToProof"><br>\n</div>\n<d
	iv style="max-width: 520px\;">\n<div style="white-space: nowrap\; margin-b
	ottom: 24px\; font-family: &quot\;Segoe UI&quot\;\, &quot\;Helvetica Neue&
