DESCRIPTION:Let’s get together and continue our conversation on help desk
	 tickets and troubleshooting issues. \n\nFor this first one\, we will go o
	ver Splunk and some of the ways to use it. \n\nHere are a few that I thoug
	ht of:\n\n*	Looking up errors based on day and time\n*	Looking up errors b
	y tracing a web login\n*	Looking up matching events in the event viewer\n*
		Looking up API errors and bad requests\n\n \n\nIf there are any other top
	ics on Splunk you want to go over\, send them to me via chat and I will ad
	d them to the list.\n\n \n\n \n\n_________________________________________
	_______________________________________\n\nMicrosoft Teams Need help? <htt
