DESCRIPTION:Wellness in 2025\n\nDescription:\nAre you interested in learnin
	g more about wellness in 2025? Would you like to take advantage of the man
	y resources and benefits that come with the DMBA wellness program? This we
	binar is a great place to start!\n\nJoin us at 8:00am for a presentation o
	utlining the 2024 Wellness Survey results and DMBA's 2025 Wellness resourc
	es\, activities\, events\, and benefits. A handout with the details of the
	 presentation will be available during the presentation and shared later w
	ith the recording link. We look forward to sharing our plans for 2025 with
	 you!\n\nDetails:\nThis will be a virtual presentation through Teams on Tu
	esday\, January 14th from 8:00-9:00am. \n\n_______________________________
	_________________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams Need he
	lp? <https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US> \nJoin the meeting now <h
	ttps://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MmMwYzQzZDgtMzE4ZC00
	NDYzLWE0YmYtZjk5MDhhMWJiZjA4%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2201154
	c1e-3942-4934-9673-5e167024374a%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22d3c0b05a-a2f0-4d5f-86e
	a-8d052c9b2f8b%22%7d> \nMeeting ID: 215 435 741 795 \nPasscode: zCVCH3 \n_
	_______________________________\n\nDial in by phone\n+1 385-500-3808\,\,21
	6860139# <tel:+13855003808\,\,216860139#>  United States\, Salt Lake City\
	nFind a local number <https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/f975897c-7bd9-4a2
	8-8156-0a5b44eeb5ca?id=216860139> \nPhone conference ID: 216 860 139# \nFo
	r organizers: Meeting options <https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/
	?organizerId=d3c0b05a-a2f0-4d5f-86ea-8d052c9b2f8b&tenantId=01154c1e-3942-4
	934-9673-5e167024374a&threadId=19_meeting_MmMwYzQzZDgtMzE4ZC00NDYzLWE0YmYt
	Zjk5MDhhMWJiZjA4@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=en-US>  | Reset dial-in PI
	N <https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/usp/pstnconferencing> \n <https://ww
	w.dmba.com/Assets/Images/bootstrap/dmbalogo.png> \nTrust • Respect • U
	nity • Excellence\nOrg help <https://www.dmba.com> \n___________________
	_____________________________________________________________\n
