DESCRIPTION:Joy in Work Workshop\n\nDescription:\nJoin us at 8:00am for an 
	interactive workshop with Jake Van Epps from the Resiliency Center at the 
	University of Utah. We will focus on where we find joy in our work and whe
	re there might be barriers to joy in work. Because this workshop requires 
	real-time engagement\, we will not be sending out a recording. We will sen
	d out a follow-up summary and any handouts we receive\, but we encourage y
	ou to RSVP and attend live if possible. \n\nDetails:\nThis will be a virtu
	al presentation through Teams on Tuesday\, November 12th from 8:00-9:00am.
	 \n\n_____________________________________________________________________
	___________\nMicrosoft Teams Need help? <https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?o
	mkt=en-US> \nJoin the meeting now <https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-jo
	in/19%3ameeting_Mjc3OTJlZjAtOTM5ZS00ZmQ5LTlkMWItZjQzZWIyMWE2N2Yx%40thread.
	v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2201154c1e-3942-4934-9673-5e167024374a%22%2c%
	22Oid%22%3a%22d3c0b05a-a2f0-4d5f-86ea-8d052c9b2f8b%22%7d> \nMeeting ID: 28
	8 758 064 922 \nPasscode: XTF7GL \n________________________________\n\nDia
	l in by phone \n+1 385-500-3808\,\,148112777# <tel:+13855003808\,\,1481127
	77#>  United States\, Salt Lake City\nFind a local number <https://dialin.
	teams.microsoft.com/f975897c-7bd9-4a28-8156-0a5b44eeb5ca?id=148112777> \nP
	hone conference ID: 148 112 777# \nFor organizers: Meeting options <https:
	//teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=d3c0b05a-a2f0-4d5f-86ea-
	8d052c9b2f8b&tenantId=01154c1e-3942-4934-9673-5e167024374a&threadId=19_mee
	ting_Mjc3OTJlZjAtOTM5ZS00ZmQ5LTlkMWItZjQzZWIyMWE2N2Yx@thread.v2&messageId=
	0&language=en-US>  | Reset dial-in PIN <https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com
	/usp/pstnconferencing> \n <https://www.dmba.com/Assets/Images/bootstrap/dm
	balogo.png> \nTrust • Respect • Unity • Excellence\nOrg help <https:
	//www.dmba.com> \n________________________________________________________
	________________________\n
