DESCRIPTION:How to Plan a Funeral Wellness Presentation\n\nDescription:\nOu
	r October wellness theme is Courageous Conversations. Conversations about 
	planning funerals can be challenging\, but they are very important. Join u
	s for an informational presentation about how to plan a funeral with Danie
	l Timothy\, Sales Manager at Larkin Mortuaries & Cemeteries. Learn practic
	al tips\, receive helpful handouts\, and ask questions!\n\nDetails:\nThis 
	will be a virtual presentation through Teams on Thursday\, October 10th fr
	om 11:00-11:45. After the live session\, there will be a recording availab
	le.\n\nSpeaker Bio: \nDan brings over 10 years of experience in the pre-pl
	anning industry to his role as Sales Manager at Larkin Mortuaries & Cemete
	ries. With a deep conviction in the emotional and financial benefits of ad
	vance planning\, he has witnessed firsthand the peace of mind it offers\, 
	both in his professional work and through personal experience\, having see
	n the difference it made with his own family members. His mission is to he
	lp families navigate the complexities of planning ahead\, ensuring that lo
	ved ones are not burdened during difficult times.\n\n_____________________
	______________________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams Ne
	ed help? <https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%
