DESCRIPTION:Join us for a short\, engaging overview of the HR team and the 
	many ways we can support you. We’ll walk through each HR role\, clarify 
	our mission and purpose\, and share how we’re refocusing our work around
	 employee wellbeing. From payroll to parking to programs and events—ever
	ything we do is designed to help you feel supported\, connected\, and able
	 to thrive at work.\n\nA recording will be available after the live presen
	tation. Hope to see you there!\n__________________________________________
