DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\nWe would like to inform you that\, due to an unfores
	eeable scheduling issue\, the company meeting will now begin at 8:00am. We
	 apologize for any inconvenience this change may cause.\n\n \n\nBreakfast 
	will be served and available starting at 7:30am in the City Creek Conferen
	ce Room\, so please feel free to arrive early and enjoy some refreshments 
	before the meeting begins.\n\n \n\nPlease let me know if you have any ques
	tions.\n\n \n\nMichele\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
