	style="word-wrap:break-word"><div class="WordSection1"><p style="mso-margi
	n-top-alt:0in\;margin-right:0in\;margin-bottom:6.0pt\;margin-left:0in"><i>
	Hello\,</i><i><span style="font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-serif">
	<o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i>We would like to inform 
	you that\, due to an unforeseeable scheduling issue\, the company meeting 
	will now begin at 8:00am. We apologize for any inconvenience this change m
	ay cause.<o:p></o:p></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></i>
	</p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><i>Breakfast will be served and available star
	ting at 7:30am in the City Creek Conference Room\, so please feel free to 
	arrive early and enjoy some refreshments before the meeting begins.<o:p></
	o:p></i></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></i></p><p class
	="MsoNormal"><i>Please let me know if you have any questions.<o:p></o:p></
	i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></i></p><p class="MsoNorma
	l"><i>Michele<o:p></o:p></i></p><p style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in\;margin-r
