DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\nYou are invited to our upcoming company meeting\, wh
	ere we will discuss important updates and new developments.\n\nLunch will 
	be available starting at 11:30am. The meeting will run from 12:00-1:00pm.\
	n\nLooking forward to a productive meeting – thanks for joining us.\n\nK
	ind regards\,\n\n \n\nMichele \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
DTEND;TZID="Mountain Standard Time":20260427T130000
