DESCRIPTION: \n\nHello friends\,\n\n \n\nCongratulations! This is a signifi
	cant year for you as you celebrate an important employee anniversary with 
	DMBA. As you reach this milestone in your career\, Andy and I are thrilled
	 to invite you to a special lunch in honor of your dedicated years of serv
	ice.  \n\n \n\nPlease accept this invitation and our heartfelt best wishes
	 as we celebrate you and your remarkable contributions to the company. We 
	look forward to commemorating this special occasion together.\n\n \n\nAndy
	 and Michele\n\n \n\n \n\n
