DESCRIPTION:Hi all!  \n\n \n\nWith the decision to move toward true sprints
	\, we’re hoping to get some help from all of you for storypointing the f
	irst couple times.  The hope is this won’t be necessary once we get the 
	lay of it because we can firm up storypoints during sprint planning\, but 
	this should make sprint planning quicker overall.  I’m scheduling anothe
	r for an hour for all non-QNXT items.  \n\n \n\nThanks!\n\n \n\n__________
