	><![endif]--><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\n<o:shapelayout v:ext="edit">\n<o:id
	map v:ext="edit" data="1" />\n</o:shapelayout></xml><![endif]--></head><bo
	dy lang="EN-US" link="#467886" vlink="#96607D" style="word-wrap:break-word
	"><div class="WordSection1"><p class="MsoNormal">Many of us have created v
	arious subagents\, skills\, commands\, etc in Claude Code. Let’s meet an
	d plan which of these assets we want to centralize into a standard “libr
	ary” and how to share them across our team. Bring your ideas and the one
	s you’ve created\, and we’ll discuss and plan together.<o:p></o:p></p>
	<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">Possible q
	uestions for our discussion:<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp
	\;</o:p></p><ul style="margin-top:0in" type="disc"><li class="MsoListParag
	raph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">What subagents or c
	ommands/skills do you think we should have in our shared repo?<o:p></o:p><
	/li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level
	1 lfo3">What naming convention and standards should we follow for these sh
	ared assets?<o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-lef
	t:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">Where should they be stored?<o:p></o:p></l
	i><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 
	lfo3">How do we make them discoverable and documented?<o:p></o:p></li><li 
	class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">
	Subagents vs skills/commands<o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" s
	tyle="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">Process for changing and c
	reating new ones<o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin
	-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">How to differentiate stable vs experim
	ental assets? <o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-l
	eft:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">Ownership<o:p></o:p></li><li class="MsoL
	istParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">Scope creep
	 and guardrails – What gets shared and what does not? How do we avoid ac
	cumulating too much and creating a big frakenlibrary?<o:p></o:p></li><li c
	lass="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:0in\;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3">A
	ssignments and next steps<o:p></o:p></li></ul><div><div style="margin-bott
	om:.25in\;overflow:hidden"><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&
	quot\;Segoe UI&quot\;\,sans-serif\;color:#242424">________________________
	________________________________________________________</span><span style
