DESCRIPTION:Subject: One Week Until Our FatCats Retreat!\n\nThe FatCats Ret
	reat is just one week away! Here are a few details to help you prepare for
	 the day:\n\n*	11:00 a.m. – Arrive at Bluffdale FatCats \n\n			*	13901 S
	. Redwood Rd\, Bluffdale\, UT 84065\n\n*	11:15 a.m. – Bowling begins pro
	mptly\n\n	*	Pick up your bowling shoes and select your bowling ball\n	*	We
	 have 11 bowling lanes reserved\, allowing groups of six. There are no ass
	igned bowling groups – join a lane with your friends or make new friends
	 😊 \n\n*	11:45 a.m. – 1:15 p.m. – Banquet lunch will be served\, 
	including unlimited soft drinks\n*	1:30 p.m. – Bowling concludes\n\n	*	R
	eturn your bowling ball and shoes\n	*	Refill your drink and make your way 
	to the movie theater\n\n*	1:45 p.m. – *Movie (TBD) and popcorn \n\n	*	Po
	pcorn will be available inside the designated theater and be sure to bring
	 your drink\n\nWe look forward to spending the day with everyone!\n\n* We
	’re hoping to catch Spider-Man: Brand New Day. We’ll keep you posted o
	nce everything is confirmed.\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n
	\n \n\n \n\n \n\n_________________________________________________________
