DESCRIPTION:All\,\n\n \n\nWe are updating our patching SLA to address the g
	rowing risk of software vulnerabilities being exploited by actors using AI
	. We’ve established a standard and SLA that need to be vetted by members
	 outside of IT Ops and Security. We would like to take a few minutes to di
	scuss the SLA and the impact it could have on operations. We’d also like
	 to evaluate windows of time that IT Ops can deploy patches without impact
	ing business operations.\n\n \n\nThank you\,\n\nTaylor\n\n________________
