DESCRIPTION:Hello\,\n\n \n\nWe’re excited to invite you to our upcoming i
	n person company meeting—a time to connect\, discuss important updates a
	nd new developments. \n\n \n\nLunch will be available beginning at 11:30 a
	.m.\, with the meeting taking place from 12:00–1:30 p.m.\n\n \n\nYour in
	sights\, collaboration\, and engagement help make these gatherings meaning
	ful\, and we look forward to spending this time together. \n\n \n\nKind re
	gards\,\n\nMichele \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n
