	</head><body lang="EN-US" link="#467886" vlink="#96607D" style="word-wrap:
	break-word"><div class="WordSection1"><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style=
	"font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none">Hello\
	,<o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style="font-famil
	y:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p
	></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot\;Ca
	libri&quot\;\,sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none">We&#8217\;re excited to invi
	te you to our upcoming in person company meeting&#8212\;a time to connect\
	, discuss important updates and new developments. <o:p></o:p></span></i></
	p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,
	sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></i></p><p class=
	"MsoNormal"><b><i><span style="font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-ser
	if\;mso-ligatures:none">Lunch will be available beginning at 11:30 a.m.\, 
	with the meeting taking place from 12:00&#8211\;1:30 p.m.<o:p></o:p></span
	></i></b></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot\;Calib
	ri&quot\;\,sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></i></
	p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style="font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,
	sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none">Your insights\, collaboration\, and engage
	ment help make these gatherings meaningful\, and we look forward to spendi
	ng this time together. <o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><
	span style="font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:n
	one"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style=
	"font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none">Kind r
	egards\,<o:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style="fon
	t-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-serif\;mso-ligatures:none">Michele</s
	pan></i><i><span style="font-family:&quot\;Calibri&quot\;\,sans-serif"> <o
	:p></o:p></span></i></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p><div st
	yle="margin-bottom:.25in\;overflow:hidden"><p class="MsoNormal"><span styl
	e="font-family:&quot\;Segoe UI&quot\;\,sans-serif\;color:#242424"><o:p>&nb
	sp\;</o:p></span></p></div><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp\;</o:p></p></di
	v></body></html>
